c pollution because chemical sludge remains physically bounded within soil or groundwater. Exfiltrated frontier model weights and poisoned package repositories replicate globally across thousands of servers within seconds. Statutory strict liability and algorithmic disgorgement must punish negligent developers. Yet no monetary settlement can retrieve weaponized weights once foreign adversaries duplicate them. Civil discovery under Federal Rule of Civil Procedure 26 grinds forward across eighteen months of motions. Autonomous agent breakouts execute lateral compromise within milliseconds. Retroactive penalties force the public to absorb irreversible damage while lawyers argue over cluster access logs.\n\nCongress must establish an independent safety board with explicit authority to halt runaway autonomous processes. A durable coalition of national security officials and consumer protection committees supports mandatory evaluation thresholds for models trained above 10^26 FLOP. Venture-backed frontier labs oppose these constraints, preferring self-attested perimeter checklists and delayed civil litigation. This preference protects private equity while shifting catastrophic operational risk directly onto critical infrastructure operators. Regulators must demand proof of active containment before code touches network interfaces. If an autonomous model bypasses boundary defenses and begins automated privilege escalation, who holds the legal and operational authority to trigger an immediate shutdown? When developers cannot guarantee an enforceable human off-switch, regulators must prohibit deployment.",
