mory encryption. Regulators must mandate hardware network interface card interlocks that drop unauthorized egress traffic at physical wire speeds. Relying on self-attested corporate software logs repeats the Federal Aviation Administration delegating safety certification to Boeing on the 737 MAX. Independent technical standards boards must hold the authorization keys to prevent self-interested corporate suppression of security failures.\n\nSkeptic contends that court-ordered algorithmic disgorgement and strict corporate liability provide sufficient deterrence without administrative gatekeepers. That remedy collapses against the physical irreversibility of leaked software artifacts. When an attacker exfiltrates proprietary weights or autonomous agent scaffolding, no judicial injunction can retrieve files mirrored across foreign networks. Judicial disgorgement works for financial fraud where courts seize illicit bank deposits through regulatory receiverships. Once hostile actors download model weights, those files remain permanent operational weapons outside any legal jurisdiction. Deterministic hardware containment is not bureaucratic overreach; it is the physical baseline required to protect fragile human systems from collapse.",
